- [Text to speech](#text-to-speech)
- [Custom TTS adapter](#custom-tts-adapter)
- [Dictation](#dictation)
- [Custom dictation adapter](#custom-dictation-adapter)
- [Suggestion adapter](#suggestion-adapter)
